Scale: the plate is about 26 cm across, so the well is roughly 17 cm wide. Each egg muffin is about 5.5 cm across and 3 cm tall, which is roughly 45 g. One muffin looks to be stacked on a second, so I counted 3 muffins, but only the 2 stacks are visible. I took the visible total as about 90 g for 2 muffins, possibly 3 if one is hidden underneath. I used 100 g to cover the stack.

The cucumber piece is about 7 cm long, 2.5 cm wide and 1.5 cm thick, so about 35 g.

There are 4 baby carrots at about 8 g each, so about 32 g.

